OL,3,GNEWSALitter picking fines expected to
OL,4,Aincrease to #500
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople caught dropping litter in an
OL,7,Farea well-known for its beaches and
OL,8,Fbeauty spots could face on-the-spot
OL,9,Ffines of up to #500.
OL,11,FNorth Norfolk District Council is
OL,12,Fexpected to increase the highest charge
OL,13,Ffor fixed penalty notices (FPN) from
OL,14,F#80 to the maximum it is legally
OL,15,Fallowed to.
OL,17,FThe Liberal Democrat-run authority will
OL,18,Falso raise fines for fly-tipping and
OL,19,Fthe move comes after large amounts of
OL,20,Fwaste were left on beaches earlier this
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
