OL,3,GNEWSALitter picking fines expected to
OL,4,Aincrease to #500
OL,5,
OL,6,FTony Bates, from Cromer, set up a
OL,7,Flitter-picking group in response and
OL,8,Fsaid the incidents had left locals
OL,9,F"embarrassed" after rubbish was left
OL,10,Fstrewn on the sand during a heatwave.
